    {
      "id": "launch-plan-detail",
      "type": "face",
      "label": "Plan document",
      "position": {
        "x": -1100,
        "y": 1233
      },
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "launch-plan-demo"
        },
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#f6faf9;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:4.4cqw 7cqw 5cqw'><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e'>Plan <span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#0f766e;border:1px solid #0f766e'>Underway</span></div><div style='font:700 5.2cqw/1.12 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#1f2937'>Launch Twilite&#39;s paid beta</div><div style='font:400 2.1cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:2cqw;max-width:62cqw'>Strangers can find Twilite, start the one-month free trial, pay when it ends, and trust that their account and their money are safe. Launch day is a planned event, not an accident.</div><div style='margin-top:1.6cqw;font:600 1.6cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>3 phases · 1 of 9 steps done · 0 of 2 milestones reached · 2 risks</div><div style='margin-top:2.6cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>1 thing to check: Confirm webhooks and cancellation</div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>Within these limits</div><div style='margin-bottom:1.4cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>One builder, limited hours</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Everything here is done by one person alongside everything else, so the plan has to be small enough to finish.</div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>The plan</div><div style='margin-bottom:3cqw;padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.2cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><span style='color:#4338ca;font:700 1.4cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-right:1.4cqw'>PHASE 1</span>Make billing trustworthy</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto'><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#4338ca;border:1px solid #4338ca'>Underway</span><span style='margin-left:1.2cqw;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>1/3</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Money moving must never surprise anyone: prove every state an account can reach.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☑</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Prove checkout and activation</b> · Michael<br>A real checkout unlocks the account. Proven.</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Handle failed payments</b> · Michael<br>What an account looks like after a failed payment, and what the person is told.</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Confirm webhooks and cancellation</b> · Michael<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span><br>Duplicate events are harmless, and cancelling through the Stripe portal leaves the account truthful.</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:3cqw;padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.2cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><span style='color:#4338ca;font:700 1.4cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-right:1.4cqw'>PHASE 2</span>Be ready for strangers</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto'><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #64748b'>Not started</span><span style='margin-left:1.2cqw;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>0/4</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>What a person who has never heard of Twilite meets first: sign-in, the free tier, a fast first load, and safe data.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Publish the legal pages</b> · Michael<br>Terms and privacy, linked from sign-in, checkout and the footer.</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Prove sign-in by email</b> · Michael<br>Codes arrive, expire and are refused when wrong, and the development-only codes are off in production.</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Define the free tier</b> · Michael<br>What is free and what is paid, written once, and the editor follows it.</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Back up the data and set alerts</b> · Michael<br>A restored backup, and an alert when a payment webhook fails or a backup is missed.</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:3cqw;padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.2cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><span style='color:#4338ca;font:700 1.4cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-right:1.4cqw'>PHASE 3</span>Launch</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto'><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #64748b'>Not started</span><span style='margin-left:1.2cqw;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>0/2</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Turn the public story into a first push, with the free trial in place.</div><div style='margin-top:.8cqw;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#b45309'>Begins when: Payments proven end to end — not yet reached · billing is proven before anyone is invited</div><div style='margin-top:.8cqw;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#b45309'>Begins when: Legal pages published — not yet reached · no launch without the terms</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Coordinate the free-trial launch</b> · Michael<br>The trial is in Stripe, disclosed at checkout, and the copy matches what happens.</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Run the first acquisition push</b> · Michael<br>The first serious attempt to bring people to the front door.</span></div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>What could go wrong</div><div style='margin-bottom:2.2cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fecaca'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>A missed webhook locks a paying person out</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto'><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#b91c1c;border:1px solid #b91c1c'>Possible</span></div></div><div style='font:600 1.4cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;margin-top:.6cqw'>Threatens: Confirm webhooks and cancellation</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>If Stripe tells us about a payment and we miss it, the person has paid and has no access.</div><div style='margin-top:1cqw;font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='color:#b91c1c'>Reduces it:</b> Handle duplicate and late events, and alert on failures.</div><div style='margin-top:.6cqw;font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='color:#b91c1c'>If it happens:</b> Fix the account by hand from Stripe within a day and tell the person.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.2cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fecaca'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>People arrive before the data is safe</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto'><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#b91c1c;border:1px solid #b91c1c'>Unlikely</span></div></div><div style='font:600 1.4cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;margin-top:.6cqw'>Threatens: Launch</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>A launch push brings the first strangers. If backups are unproven, one bad day costs real accounts.</div><div style='margin-top:1cqw;font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='color:#b91c1c'>Reduces it:</b> Prove a restored backup before the push.</div><div style='margin-top:.6cqw;font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='color:#b91c1c'>If it happens:</b> Pause the push and restore from the last good backup.</div></div></div></div>"
        },
